<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Druid Spells</h1>
<p>The spells the Druids' guild teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name               Level   Up to
Sense Life             1   100%
Thorn Strike           2   100%
Bark Skin              3   100%
Glowing Fungus         5   100%
Sense Invisible        6   100%
Summer Rain            7   100%
Mud Puddle             8   100%
Refresh                8   100%
Poison Ivy             9   100%
Wind Slash            10   100%
Brambles              12   100%
Detect Alignment      12   100%
Heal Animal           13   100%
Life Protection       14   100%
Charm Animal          15   100%
Detect Poison         16   100%
Ice Thorn             17   100%
Locate Animal         19   100%
Entangle              21   100%
Hedge Wall            21   100%
Sustain               22   80%
Remove Disease        25   100%
Calm                  26   80%
Remove Poison         28   100%
Cure Blind            29   80%
Petrify               30   100%
Quicksand             31   100%
Find Path             34   100%
Locate Object         35   100%
Locate Person         37   100%
Sun Ray               41   100%
Clear Skies           43   100%
Leaf Shield           47   100%
Tsunami               52   100%
Summon Lightning      60   100%
Earthquake            90   100%
Polarity             120   100%
</pre>
